@@ -0,0 +1,19 @@
+# Feature Specification: Task timestamps
+
+**Created**: 2026-11-20 | **Status**: Implemented
+**Input**: Record when each task was created and last changed.
+
+## Requirements
+- **FR-001**: Every task has `createdAt` and `updatedAt`, ISO-8601 date-time strings.
+- **FR-002**: On add, both are equal.
+- **FR-003**: Complete, reopen, rename, tag and untag set `updatedAt` to the time of the change; `createdAt` never changes. A failed change leaves the task untouched.
+- **FR-004**: The domain does not read the clock (constitution): `createTaskList(now)` takes a clock function; `createTodoList(now?)` defaults it to the system clock outside the domain.
+
+## Plan
+Add the fields to `Task`; thread a `now` string through the pure task functions; inject the clock into the list.
+
+## Tasks
+- [x] Task type and pure functions
+- [x] List clock injection
+- [x] Public `createTodoList` default clock
+- [x] Tests
